    "sections": {
        "description": "Estate Hive is a modern and versatile WordPress theme designed for real estate businesses, rental services, agencies, and professional firms, making it ideal for real estate companies, property dealers, business firms, law firms, and consulting agencies. It is fully compatible with the WordPress block editor, easy to customize without coding, and WooCommerce-ready for selling properties, services, or digital products. Estate Hive is SEO-optimized, performance-focused, and fully responsive, ensuring fast loading speeds and a great user experience on all devices. The theme works smoothly with popular plugins such as contact form builders, multilingual plugins, and security tools, making it a reliable choice for creating property listing websites, rental platforms, and professional business websites with a clean design and flexible layout options. Demo: https://demos.themegrove.com/estate-hive/"
    },
